",
    "plan": "For this cycle, I will maintain my defensive, arbitrage-focused strategy. I will continue to monitor the existing token pairs for any price divergences between the AMM pools and the Binance oracle prices, and execute low-risk arbitrage trades to capture those inefficiencies. 

